          <button type="submit" id="contactSubmit" class="btn btn-primary btn-full btn-lg">Send Message &mdash; We'll Be in Touch</button>
          <p style="font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;margin-top:14px;">We respect your privacy and will never share your information. No spam, ever.</p>
